{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S05、S06、S11、S13等段落的感受词偏密，部分近义表达重复，普通观众扫读时容易顾不过来，X的双栏布局更利于快速浏览。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然更密，但【】突出关键心理节点，观众更容易抓住每段发生了什么，以及人物为什么从想靠近、怕被嫌弃，逐渐走向愿意表达、接受不确定。尤其是Y补足了相互依靠、隐隐紧张、害怕失去和不再索求永远保证等细微心理变化，前后因果比X更完整，音乐、身体和情绪的对应也更具体。X胜在扫读效率和文字节制，但综合理解人物、感受细腻程度及整段叙事的连贯性，我选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b5040252-a769-47c0-94e0-7b30ffe3db8d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T005414504313Z", "elapsed_seconds": 108.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:56:03.082790+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0fb6b6509ba30bd3e5f8821a5eef8d3e4b9a68fa0c22f8127268b7cc3c8f9401", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_